  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educate 100 Children with Disabilities in Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Syria, over 10,000 children with physical disabilities face educational challenges. Already burdened by the birth defects and war injuries, living in makeshift camps far from schools, they lack the necessary support and resources to continue their studies. Our goal is to extend a helping hand to these students, enabling them to receive quality education and thrive in society. With your support, we can empower more than 100 students with physical challenges. Help them learn and grow.</narrative>
  </description>
